<div class="hero-image">
  <%= image_tag "pages/home-hero.jpg", alt: "An African elephant dust-bathing, shown from trunk to tail", class: "hero-photo" %>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <h1 class="page-title">Hi, elephant explorer!</h1>
  <p class="page-subtitle">
    Are you doing a school project about elephants? You're in the right place! Here you'll find facts and pictures
    to help you make a great poster, presentation or report.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <span class="section-label">Pick a topic</span>
  <div class="card-grid">
    <% [
      ["🌍", "Life in the Wild", life_in_the_wild_path, "Where elephants live, and what they get up to all day."],
      ["🌳", "Family Tree", classification_path, "Meet the three kinds of elephants and their cousins, the mammoths."],
      ["📷", "Photos", gallery_index_path, "Look at pictures of elephants in the wild."],
      ["🐘", "Bodies & Food", body_and_food_path, "Trunks, tusks, giant ears, and a LOT of plants to eat!"],
      ["⭐", "Famous Elephants", pop_culture_path, "Dumbo, Babar, Elmer and other elephant stars."]
    ].each do |icon, title, path, blurb| %>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true"><%= icon %></div>
        <h3><%= title %></h3>
        <p><%= blurb %></p>
        <%= link_to "Let's go →", path, class: "card-link", aria: { label: "Let's go to #{title}" } %>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <span class="section-label">Wow facts</span>
  <div class="stat-row">
    <div class="stat-card" data-mascot-fact="The heaviest elephant ever recorded weighed about 10,900 kg, roughly as much as 150 adult people!">
      <div class="stat-label">Weight</div>
      <div class="stat-value">6,000 kg</div>
      <p>A big male African elephant weighs about as much as 4 cars!</p>
      <%= copy_button "Weight" %>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-card" data-mascot-fact="The oldest known elephant, Lin Wang, lived to 86 at a zoo in Taiwan.">
      <div class="stat-label">Lifespan</div>
      <div class="stat-value">60–70 years</div>
      <p>Wild elephants can live to be as old as your grandparents.</p>
      <%= copy_button "Lifespan" %>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-card" data-mascot-fact="An elephant can breathe in through its trunk at over 500 km/h, about 30 times faster than a human sneeze.">
      <div class="stat-label">Trunk</div>
      <div class="stat-value">~40,000</div>
      <p>Muscle bundles in an elephant's trunk.</p>
      <%= copy_button "Trunk" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="highlight-box">
  <p>
    <strong>Project tip:</strong> Pick one topic. Write down 3 facts you like. Then explain them in your own words,
    and add a picture to show what you mean.
  </p>
</div>
